OL,3,GNEWSAVenue revamp could see average
OL,4,Aticket prices double
OL,5,
OL,6,FAverage ticket prices could double for
OL,7,Fa city venue after it undergoes a
OL,8,F#26.5m refurbishment.
OL,10,FThe Corn Exchange in Cambridge is set
OL,11,Fto be redeveloped as part of the wider
OL,12,F#97.5m Civic Quarter project, which
OL,13,Faims to revitalise the city centre.
OL,15,FPerformances at the venue are estimated
OL,16,Fto increase from 180 a year to 340,
OL,17,Fwith average ticket prices for
OL,18,Fcouncil-run events set to rise from #24
OL,19,Fplus VAT to #50 or more with VAT in
OL,20,Fyear five of the new venue's opening.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
