OL,3,GNEWSAVenue revamp could see average
OL,4,Aticket prices double
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour councillor Beth Gardiner-Smith
OL,7,Fsaid: "What I don't think we want to
OL,8,Fsee, but maybe others would disagree,
OL,9,Fis that people across Cambridge are
OL,10,Fpriced out of going to events on a
OL,11,Fregular basis at the Corn Exchange."
